OpenBook is an important public open-source standard. Never edit this repository unless the human explicitly authorised that exact change.

A question is not permission. Default to answer-only: no files, no commits, no PRs.

Before doing anything, ask one detailed question, wait, then the next if needed. Never batch questions. Never infer permission from a run name or another agent.

Read and explain freely. After authorisation, do only the named work — smallest diff, no extras.
